# listed here ahead of the SPA catch-all, or /api/* requests get index.html (keep in sync with netlify.toml).
/api/webhooks/zoom       /.netlify/functions/zoom-webhook        200!
/api/webhooks/toyyibpay  /.netlify/functions/toyyibpay-callback  200!
/api/toyyibpay           /.netlify/functions/toyyibpay-api       200!
/*  /index.html  200
